  * Carries a marker line in console.py so the redeploy-on-upgrade behaviour can be verified by
    CONTENT, not only by a timestamp: after `apt upgrade kubeos-dashboard` the deployed
    /usr/lib/kubeos-console/console.py must contain it without anyone stopping or starting the
